Hurrah!  I've ascended a tourist!  I always thought of this class as
the hardest one.  The beginning was hard and it took me 4 tries to get
it right.  The tourist quest gets my vote for best one so far - lots of
shops and that means lots of stuff!

I had a close call with a mindflayer in the Wizards tower but my helmet
blocked all four attacks.  Whew!

I also had an Archon with me but I lost it on the plane of water when I
blundered into the portal and onto astral.  I still haven't figured out
a good way to bring pets through all four plane onto astral.  Which is
ok I suppose, because I rarely use pets, except for Archons.

I had to go to all three altars this game.  On the right side summon
Kirin summoned a ton of monsters.  That was annoying to get through,
but it kept Death away from me.

Note to self - Two +7 silver sabers beat any artifact as far as I'm
concerned with the possible exception of Grayswandir since that is a
saber too.

Joeb, neutral male human Tourist


